            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "PennantPark Investment Corporation (PNNT): A Steady Performer in the BDC Space",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "PennantPark Investment Corporation (NYSE:PNNT) is included among the 11 Best BDC Stocks to Buy Now. PennantPark Investment Corporation (NYSE:PNNT) is a business development company that invests in mid-sized firms \u2014 the kinds that typically don\u2019t receive much attention from traditional banks. Because of that, it\u2019s often able to secure higher returns on the loans it issues. [\u2026]",
